stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CH_IDLE
    CH_IDLE --> CH_FETCH_DESC: descriptor_valid and channel enabled
    CH_FETCH_DESC --> CH_XFER_DATA: descriptor valid bit set
    CH_FETCH_DESC --> CH_ERROR: valid bit clear
    CH_XFER_DATA --> CH_XFER_DATA: read-ahead advance (prefetch)
    CH_XFER_DATA --> CH_COMPLETE: all beats read and all writes committed
    CH_COMPLETE --> CH_NEXT_DESC: chained (next_ptr != 0, not last)
    CH_COMPLETE --> CH_IDLE: last, all writes committed
    CH_NEXT_DESC --> CH_FETCH_DESC: next descriptor ready
    CH_XFER_DATA --> CH_ERROR: engine error or escalated timeout
    CH_ERROR --> CH_IDLE: channel reset
